  <layout>One page of verse in a single column, below a running head and a title; catchword at lower right. No marginal notes.</layout>
  <page_number>96</page_number>
  <running_head>VARIA POEMATA</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
    <catchword>Gemellíque</catchword>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" type="heading" level="2" para="true">LAVS SPECILLORVM.</l>
    <l n="2" para="true">
      <i>Hic laudis meruit decus perenne,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="3">
      <i>Qui vitri geminos nitentis orbes</i>
    </l>
    <l n="4">
      <i>Primus, eximiæ Magister artis,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="5">
      <i>Nasis turgidulis micare iussit</i>
    </l>
    <l n="6">
      <i>Pendentes, vitreis nouisque ocellis,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="7">
      <i>Ceu bina face, folibúsque[?] binis,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8">
      <i>Vel ceu splendidulis inuare flammis</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9">
      <i>Languentes oculos, tenebricosos,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10">
      <i>Annosos simul atque lippientes,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="11">
      <i>Doctus: quum senio retusus hæret</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12">
      <i>Visus, pupula quum stillet[?] tenell-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13">
      <i>a Morbo debilitata sæuiore.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14" para="true">
      <i>Artis qui Medicæ peritiores</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15">
      <i>Machaon, Podalyriúsque frater,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16">
      <i>Illorúmque parens vel ipse Chiron,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17">
      <i>Ausi[?] temporibus prioris ævi</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18">
      <i>Herbarum varias docere vires,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19">
      <i>Et collyria Lumini tuendo,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20">
      <i>Nescíuere vitri micantis vsus.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21" para="true">
      <i>Hic sparsos oculi coercet ignes,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22">
      <i>Extinctos renocat, nouo &amp; latenti</i>
    </l>
    <l n="23">
      <i>Sopitos vegetans vigore sensus,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="24">
      <i>Et longo recreat labore fessos.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="25" para="true">
      <i>Vitreis oculis nouis gemellis</i>
    </l>
    <l n="26">
      <i>Gemelli iuuenum vigent ocelli,</i>
    </l>
  </main_text>
  <notes>Long s rendered as s throughout; u/v and i/j normalised. Doubtful: "folibúsque" (letter shapes uncertain, possibly "solibusque"), "stillet" (rendered with a ligature-like form), and "Ausi" (the printed form looks like "Aufi"). The "vegetans" word has a superscript mark over the n that may be a stray ink spot. Catchword "Gemellíque" is set at the right below the last line.</notes>
</page>
